{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_135_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_135","textTraditional":"一、三年，春，王正月，公會晉侯、宋公、衞侯、曹伯伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_135_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_135","textTraditional":"二、辛亥，葬衞穆公。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_135_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_135","textTraditional":"三、二月，公至自伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_135_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_135","textTraditional":"四、甲子，新宮災，三日哭。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_135_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_135","textTraditional":"新宮者，禰宮也。三日哭，哀也。其哀，禮也。迫近不敢稱謚，恭也。其辭恭且哀，以成公為無譏矣。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_135_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_135","textTraditional":"五、乙亥，葬宋文公。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_135_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_135","textTraditional":"六、夏，公如晉。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_135_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_135","textTraditional":"七、鄭公子去疾帥師伐許。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_135_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_135","textTraditional":"八、公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_135_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_135","textTraditional":"九、秋，叔孫僑如帥師圍棘。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_135_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_135","textTraditional":"十、大雩。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_135_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_135","textTraditional":"十一、晉郤克、衞孫良夫伐廧咎如。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_135_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_135","textTraditional":"十二、冬，十有一月，晉侯使荀庚來聘。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_135_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_135","textTraditional":"十三、衞侯使孫良夫來聘。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_135_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_135","textTraditional":"十四、丙午，及荀庚盟。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_135_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_135","textTraditional":"十五、丁未，及孫良夫盟。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_clt_135_17","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_135","textTraditional":"其日，公也。來聘而求盟，不言及之者，以國與之也。不言其人，亦以國與之也。不言求，兩欲之也。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_clt_135_18","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_135","textTraditional":"十六、鄭伐許。","sentenceOrder":18}],"overrides":{}}